<title>USA: Chad sets three percent stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Chad sets three percent stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chad Therapeutics Inc said Tuesday its board has approved a three percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be distributed by October 15 to all shareholders of record as of October 1.</p>
</text>
